  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 1st level, the radiant adds her Wisdom modifier to her Constitution modifier for Fortitude saving throws and when determining the total number of hit points gained each time she gains a level in the radiant class. In addition, she adds her Wisdom score to her Constitution score when determining the maximum number of negative hit points she can reach before dying.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/radiant#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
